PROOF ARROW_OPTIONAL PACK : real Burnpack save / restore
PROTOCOL ARROW_ERROR FAILURE : invalid framing / version / id\ninvalid shape / excess bytes
LIB ARROW_ERROR FAILURE : invalid numeric input\nno JS or f32 fallback
